“The current administration of Bolivia has benefited the problem of access to the sea for criminal purposes,” says Zarate.
According to her, the belligerent Rhetoric of Morales destroyed the last Chilean benevolence.
Bolivia and Chile at some point will continue negotiations, but after that it will be extremely difficult to conduct discussions.
These two countries do not have diplomatic relations since 1962.
