“Monday will bring Bolivia an “exclusive opportunity to start a new epoch of relations with Chile” and a chance “to put an end an end to 139 years of mutual benefit,” he argues.
Kalzadilla also does not agree that Morales, still one of the most popular presidents in Latin America, uses the naval problem as a political contrugregator.
